iven id."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example shows how to delete a document:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["try await wallet.deleteDocument(id: documentId, status: .issued)"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To delete all documents you can use "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/EudiWallet\/deleteAllDocuments()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]},{"text":"Credential Reuse Policy Mapping","anchor":"Credential-Reuse-Policy-Mapping","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When ETSI TS 119 472-3 Once-Only reuse method is applied, the oneTimeUse credential policy is used."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When ETSI TS 119 472-3 Limited-time reuse method is applied, the rotateUse credential policy is used and the batch size is set to 1."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When ETSI TS 119 472-3 Rotating-Batch reuse method is applied, the rotateUse credential policy is used.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Refreshing usage counters","anchor":"Refreshing-usage-counters","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/EudiWallet\/refreshUsageCounters()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" method synchronizes the wallet’s cached usage counter values with the actual state on the device."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Usage counters track how many times a document can be presented (for one-time use policies). When a presentation occurs in another application (such as DC-API extension) that shares access to the secure area, the wallet’s cached counters may become out of sync. This method refreshes those cached valu